{
  "title": "EOL Risk Overview",
  "description": "Software end-of-life risk for the software you run, powered by endoflife.ai (0-100 EOL Risk Scores; every date labelled with its source). Products detected on your hosts or listed in EOL_PRODUCTS, plus stack-scan scores per host. Learn more: https://endoflife.ai",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "About endoflife.ai",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "## endoflife.ai — EOL Risk Overview\n\n**Risk Score (0–100)**: EOL recency + attack surface + CISA KEV exposure + extended-support availability. Higher = more dangerous to keep running. Grades: A (low) to F (critical).\n\n**Your software only:** product metrics (`endoflife.risk_score`, `endoflife.days_until_eol`) cover the products the exporter detected on your hosts or that you listed in `EOL_PRODUCTS` (tag `detected:true`, the `$detected` default); the full catalog is opt-in (`EOL_FULL_CATALOG=1`, tagged `detected:false`). **Stack-scan metrics** (`endoflife.stack_risk_score`) are per host, tagged by `host_name`. `eol_phase` splits products **approaching** EOL (plan the upgrade) from **past** EOL (remediate: regular vendor security updates have stopped).\n\nEvery date names its source: the vendor's own lifecycle page for the products endoflife.ai verifies directly, the open endoflife.date dataset for the rest. Methodology: https://endoflife.ai/accuracy",
              "background_color": "yellow",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "vertical_align": "center",
              "show_tick": false,
              "tick_pos": "50%",
              "tick_edge": "left",
              "has_padding": true
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Overview",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Past EOL + actively exploited (CISA KEV)",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{kev_active:true,$product,$eol_phase,$grade,$detected} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "count_nonzero(clamp_max(query1, -1))"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Average EOL Risk Score",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "description": "Current average across the full catalog of 600+ monitored products.",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "avg:endoflife.risk_score{$detected}",
                      "aggregator": "avg"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 40,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<",
                      "value": 60,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">=",
                      "value": 60,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": false,
              "precision": 2,
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 3,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Nearest upcoming EOL deadline (days)",
              "title_size": "16",
              "title_align": "left",
              "type": "query_value",
              "precision": 0,
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{eol_phase:approaching,$product,$grade,$detected}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1"
                    }
                  ],
                  "conditional_formats": [
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 30,
                      "palette": "white_on_red"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": "<=",
                      "value": 90,
                      "palette": "white_on_yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "comparator": ">",
                      "value": 90,
                      "palette": "white_on_green"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Hosts running at-risk software (stack scan)",
              "type": "query_value",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "max:endoflife.stack_risk_score{*} by {host_name}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "count_nonzero(query1)"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "autoscale": true,
              "precision": 0,
              "timeseries_background": {
                "type": "area"
              }
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 9,
              "y": 2,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Stack Scan — Your Hosts",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Your riskiest hosts (stack scan)",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "max:endoflife.stack_risk_score{*} by {host_name,product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1",
                      "limit": {
                        "count": 15,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 4,
              "width": 6,
              "height": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Lifecycle Deadlines — Approaching vs Past",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Approaching EOL — days remaining",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{eol_phase:approaching,$product,$grade,$detected} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "query1",
                      "limit": {
                        "count": 15,
                        "order": "asc"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "asc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 4,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 3
            }
          },
          {
            "definition": {
              "title": "Past EOL — days overdue",
              "type": "toplist",
              "requests": [
                {
                  "queries": [
                    {
                      "name": "query1",
                      "data_source": "metrics",
                      "query": "min:endoflife.days_until_eol{eol_phase:past,$product,$grade,$detected} by {product}",
                      "aggregator": "last"
                    }
                  ],
                  "response_format": "scalar",
                  "formulas": [
                    {
                      "formula": "abs(query1)",
                      "limit": {
                        "count": 15,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "sort": {
                    "count": 25,
                    "order_by": [
                      {
                        "type": "formula",
                        "index": 0,
                        "order": "desc"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "custom_links": [
                {
                  "label": "View {{product.value}} on endoflife.ai",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/{{product.value}}"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Full risk-score methodology",
                  "link": "https://endoflife.ai/risk-score"
                }
              ]
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 9,
              "y": 4,
              "width": 3,
              "height": 3
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Your Software by Risk",
        "type": "group",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "widgets": [
